  "reason": "The strongest completed result is config_024, a multimodal multiprofile model using PCA, ViT-L, avgpool, and concat, with validation accuracy 0.6287 and F1 0.5993, clearly above the RNA-only PCA avgpool baseline of 0.5907. The main untested factor in this promising setup is fusion type. config_025 changes only fusion from concat to weighted, keeping the otherwise best-known representation, profile setting, and aggregation. This isolates the effect of fusion, is a direct exploitation of the current best direction, and has high expected performance while reducing uncertainty about whether weighted fusion can improve further."
